@@ -0,0 +1,254 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note */
+/*
+ *
+ * (C) COPYRIGHT 2018-2024 ARM Limited. All rights reserved.
+ *
+ * This program is free software and is provided to you under the terms of the
